# WP-021 golden: the player hits the training dummy with the three-hit light chain
# (record with `lf-tools replay record-script`). Each line: <ticks> <move_x> <move_z>
# [BUTTONS]. The player spawns at the origin facing +Z; dummy_ahead stands at z = 6.
# Walking 60 ticks at 1.6 m/s stops the player 2.8 m short of the dummy, so each light's
# root motion carries it into range without passing through the dummy.
seed 21
scenario test_field
60 0  30           # walk forward 3.2 m
5  0  0            # stand
1  0  0  LIGHT     # ss_light_1, frame 0
15 0  0
1  0  0  LIGHT     # frame 16: buffered, ss_light_2 starts on frame 21
20 0  0
1  0  0  LIGHT     # ss_light_2 frame 16: buffered, ss_light_3 starts on frame 21
60 0  0            # ss_light_3 runs out; stand
